WEBVTT

01:31.520 --> 01:35.320
My mother has agreed to let me try,
but now I need a path I can actually take.

01:37.080 --> 01:38.360
It cannot be done!

01:39.120 --> 01:42.480
I have told you, it cannot be done!
Why will you not listen?

01:44.400 --> 01:46.880
This path has thwarted countless veterans.

01:46.960 --> 01:48.880
What makes you think you will succeed?

01:48.960 --> 01:50.600
Do you think you are Zhang Qian?

01:50.680 --> 01:52.520
Even with Zhang Qian and his group,

01:52.600 --> 01:55.480
you know how many years it took
and how many lives were lost.

01:56.160 --> 01:58.080
Yu, why are you getting so worked up?

02:00.280 --> 02:01.760
I only want to warn you

02:02.280 --> 02:04.520
that this path is truly perilous.

02:04.600 --> 02:06.640
I know it is dangerous,

02:06.720 --> 02:09.080
but isn't every new road in this world
forged through risk?

02:09.160 --> 02:10.880
This road is different!

02:17.440 --> 02:18.920
VALLEY OF DEATH

02:21.560 --> 02:23.080
It is called the Valley of Death.

02:25.280 --> 02:27.480
My father died there long ago.

02:33.000 --> 02:34.680
Like you, he was full of ambition,

02:35.200 --> 02:37.640
hoping to carve a new path
for the merchants.

02:37.720 --> 02:39.120
But in the end?

02:42.160 --> 02:46.520
My mother and I waited,
but he never returned from that road.

02:49.200 --> 02:53.200
- Yu!
- Most wrong paths let you turn back,

02:53.960 --> 02:55.840
but a road of life and death

02:57.040 --> 02:58.600
offers

02:59.680 --> 03:01.160
no second chances.

03:08.440 --> 03:10.280
SAN HUA PAVILION

03:10.360 --> 03:15.240
I have heard, Ms. Ji, that you are seeking
a trade route from Yizhou to Tubo.

03:15.840 --> 03:18.600
I brought a map for you today,

03:19.200 --> 03:22.080
hoping it might help resolve your dilemma.

03:25.920 --> 03:27.720
Why is it that whenever
I venture into business,

03:27.800 --> 03:30.200
you always seem to appear
at my doorstep, Mr. Bai?

03:31.000 --> 03:34.040
Tell me. Are you truly my benefactor, or…

03:35.480 --> 03:36.320
Or what?

03:37.120 --> 03:39.840
Or do you have some other motive?

03:48.200 --> 03:50.080
You have guessed correctly, Ms. Ji.

03:50.600 --> 03:53.560
I do have ulterior motives
in coming here today.

03:55.240 --> 03:58.160
I wish to accompany you on your journey.

04:02.600 --> 04:05.440
Exploring a new trade route
is fraught with danger.

04:05.960 --> 04:08.800
Why would a man of your status
risk such peril?

04:09.320 --> 04:10.280
What do you seek?

04:14.200 --> 04:15.640
It is nothing extraordinary.

04:15.720 --> 04:18.839
Just two simple things. Fame and fortune.

04:19.519 --> 04:21.120
Let's start with fortune.

04:21.720 --> 04:25.720
The greater the risk
in establishing a new trade route,

04:25.800 --> 04:28.080
the greater the reward.

04:29.480 --> 04:31.680
Swamps, bandits…

04:32.520 --> 04:36.400
Many are blinded
by the dangers on the surface

04:36.480 --> 04:37.720
and fail to see this.

04:37.800 --> 04:40.400
If a new route is successfully explored,

04:40.480 --> 04:42.960
it will not just carry Shu brocade.

04:43.560 --> 04:48.360
There will be carpets, spices,
herbs, and silk.

04:48.880 --> 04:50.960
Each worth a fortune.

04:53.600 --> 04:54.960
And as for fame?

04:55.720 --> 05:00.160
To be the one who explores such a path,
my name will be remembered by all.

05:00.240 --> 05:01.920
It will be etched into history

05:03.000 --> 05:04.080
and immortalized for generations.

05:05.960 --> 05:07.560
Is it not an enticing prospect?

05:09.040 --> 05:12.120
It is rather tempting.
But I still do not understand.

05:13.040 --> 05:15.920
With your wealth, ambition,

05:16.000 --> 05:17.800
and this map in hand,

05:17.880 --> 05:19.560
why not simply hire others
to pave the way?

05:22.040 --> 05:23.800
When it comes to it,

05:23.880 --> 05:27.520
Shu brocade originates from Yizhou,
from the Tang Empire itself.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.560
In the eyes of foreign merchants,

05:29.640 --> 05:32.240
only Tang Empire can truly be called
a majestic empire.

05:32.320 --> 05:36.040
Only Tang Empire could produce
such rare treasures.

05:36.640 --> 05:38.960
Every piece is indeed a masterpiece.

05:40.400 --> 05:41.360
As for me,

05:41.960 --> 05:44.920
I am merely a merchant from Nanzhao.

05:45.840 --> 05:48.240
My origins are far from remarkable.

05:48.320 --> 05:52.440
What is more, the road ahead
is filled with checkpoints.

05:53.080 --> 05:57.120
The documents of Tang Empire
will be quite useful.

05:58.800 --> 06:00.720
It is rare to hear you speak
with such humility, Mr. Bai.

06:03.520 --> 06:06.440
Ms. Ji, would you like to hear the truth?

06:07.800 --> 06:09.680
Why? Were you not truthful earlier?

06:09.760 --> 06:13.880
I was honest earlier,
but it was not the most important truth.

06:14.600 --> 06:18.400
The most important reason
is that I wish to travel alongside you.

06:18.480 --> 06:20.000
If it were anyone else,

06:20.520 --> 06:23.200
I might not have agreed to go.

06:26.360 --> 06:27.360
What do you mean by that, Mr. Bai?

06:32.400 --> 06:34.280
I mean, Ms. Ji,

06:35.080 --> 06:39.960
you have a way of surprising me,
and I happen to enjoy surprises.

06:42.120 --> 06:43.640
I will take that as a compliment, Mr. Bai.

06:48.520 --> 06:51.160
But this map is incomplete.

06:51.680 --> 06:54.920
Indeed, there are parts of the route
that even I do not know how to go.

06:55.600 --> 06:59.320
But then again,
if the path was one we both knew,

06:59.400 --> 07:01.680
how could it truly be called
an exploration?

07:03.880 --> 07:05.680
THE YANG RESIDENCE

07:05.760 --> 07:08.480
Bai Sheng is not one
to act without purpose.

07:08.560 --> 07:10.760
For him to volunteer for this journey,

07:11.640 --> 07:13.640
I think there must be more to it
than meets the eye.

07:15.040 --> 07:16.760
The trade route is already perilous.

07:16.840 --> 07:20.320
Adding a dangerous man like him
will only double the risk.

07:21.360 --> 07:22.360
Yingying,

07:22.440 --> 07:25.600
accusing a foreign prince
over a single piece of tribute brocade

07:26.120 --> 07:29.240
might seem like making a big deal
out of nothing to the court.

07:29.760 --> 07:31.920
Which is why I must gather more evidence

07:32.000 --> 07:35.360
to prove
Prince Bai and Niu Jin's collusion.

07:35.880 --> 07:40.240
Only then will my senior in Chang'an
have the leverage he needs to negotiate.

07:41.760 --> 07:45.840
But for now, here, in Yizhou,
he will not make a move unless I do,

07:45.920 --> 07:47.920
and I will not act unless he does.

07:48.000 --> 07:50.360
We are at a stalemate.

07:51.680 --> 07:55.920
The longer this drags on,
the worse it is for us.

07:57.760 --> 08:01.320
If he is taking action now,
it is certainly with a plan in mind.

08:01.400 --> 08:04.040
But I have come up with a plan myself.

08:06.920 --> 08:08.160
What is your plan?

08:13.160 --> 08:14.320
Do you want to know?

08:23.600 --> 08:26.240
Who says evidence
must always be written on paper?

08:30.000 --> 08:33.400
Yang Jinglan,
during the years you wandered around,

08:33.919 --> 08:35.559
there must have been many people
who hated you.

08:36.400 --> 08:38.120
Back then,
I did not have the wisdom I do now.

08:38.200 --> 08:39.919
It is all thanks to your guidance,
Yingying.

08:40.000 --> 08:42.600
Since there is no clear path,
why not take a gamble?

08:46.560 --> 08:50.120
Your idea is indeed risky.

08:50.760 --> 08:51.840
But what if…

08:55.880 --> 08:56.920
This…

08:57.640 --> 09:00.680
This is something the people told me
when I was in the north.

09:00.760 --> 09:02.680
Hunters there often
go deep into the mountains

09:02.760 --> 09:04.080
to cut a specific type of wood.

09:04.160 --> 09:06.360
They carve it into beads
and string them together as bracelets

09:06.440 --> 09:07.560
to give to their wives.

09:07.640 --> 09:09.040
It is called Never Lost.

09:10.000 --> 09:11.200
Never Lost?

09:13.000 --> 09:15.120
Never abandoned,
never straying from one's heart.

09:17.200 --> 09:20.760
Yingying, no matter
what happens in the future,

09:21.280 --> 09:23.800
you and I will never lose each other.

09:25.720 --> 09:27.960
Never Lost. How charming.

09:29.280 --> 09:32.240
Yang Jinglan, teach me a few more moves.

09:32.320 --> 09:33.720
Something easy to learn yet effective.

09:34.360 --> 09:37.600
That way, if we ever face danger
and you are not by my side,

09:37.680 --> 09:39.200
I will be able to protect myself.

09:39.920 --> 09:42.160
Just like last time. Something like this.

09:42.680 --> 09:45.240
- A deadly move!
- All right.

09:50.560 --> 09:51.800
Face me.

09:52.800 --> 09:55.120
Use your right hand and strike here.

09:55.880 --> 09:57.080
On your face?

10:05.760 --> 10:06.920
- Yang Jinglan!
- This is the ultimate move.

10:07.000 --> 10:09.640
It is called, when all else fails,
seek your husband.

10:29.440 --> 10:31.360
I did not mean to hide this from you all.

10:31.880 --> 10:34.800
It is just that this journey
will be fraught with challenges,

10:35.480 --> 10:37.000
and I did not want you to worry.

10:37.640 --> 10:39.040
We are not worried.

10:40.360 --> 10:42.280
Bloom Society is also working
to open a new trade route.

10:42.360 --> 10:44.120
We simply happen to be heading
the same way as you.

10:46.280 --> 10:48.360
What trade route will you open?

10:48.440 --> 10:49.760
Are you traveling thousands of miles
just to sell silk?

10:49.840 --> 10:52.960
Mr. Yu has entrusted us
to sell his brocade.

10:54.960 --> 10:56.800
And the first batch of brocade
from Ji's Brocade Workshop,

10:58.200 --> 10:59.840
though small,

10:59.920 --> 11:02.680
is ready to see the world.

11:02.760 --> 11:05.240
Yaoting, why are you indulging
in their nonsense too?

11:07.840 --> 11:10.360
Let us do it this way.
Wait until I secure the new trade route,

11:10.440 --> 11:12.080
and it will not be too late
for you to start.

11:12.160 --> 11:13.320
Enough.

11:13.840 --> 11:17.440
I, Jiang Liu, and Pin will stay behind
to manage the business.

11:17.520 --> 11:21.600
Sheng Dalang, Sang Shisi, and your brother
will take a few men and travel with you.

11:22.840 --> 11:23.760
Let me make one thing clear.

11:24.560 --> 11:26.040
I am not scared.

11:26.920 --> 11:29.440
We decided by a game of dice, and I lost.

11:31.000 --> 11:32.280
It is just bad luck on my part.

11:33.000 --> 11:34.560
When it comes to martial arts,

11:34.640 --> 11:36.320
I may not be as skilled as Mr. Yang.

11:37.560 --> 11:41.480
But with me among us,
with my noble appetite…

11:41.560 --> 11:42.400
Noble lineage!

11:43.840 --> 11:46.840
Oh, who cares!
Who would dare to trouble us?

11:48.640 --> 11:51.040
On my end, I have packed
all the medicine we will need.

11:51.960 --> 11:54.520
For men, for women,

11:55.160 --> 11:57.200
for colds, for rashes,

11:58.000 --> 12:00.560
to calm the mind, soothe the nerves,

12:01.160 --> 12:02.240
and even for pregnancy.

12:03.320 --> 12:04.560
Everything we could possibly need
is ready.

12:04.640 --> 12:06.960
Bringing me along
is like having a physician at your side!

12:07.040 --> 12:09.360
Wait a moment. Medicine for pregnancy?

12:11.320 --> 12:12.320
Just in case…

12:12.400 --> 12:14.680
- It is always better to be prepared!
- It is always better to be prepared!

12:16.440 --> 12:19.400
Yingying,
here's a protective charm I prayed for.

12:19.480 --> 12:21.720
Take it with you,
and be extra careful on the road.

12:22.640 --> 12:24.560
I originally wanted to join you,

12:24.640 --> 12:26.120
but my mother is unwell.

12:26.200 --> 12:27.480
Unwell?

12:27.560 --> 12:29.240
When did she fall ill? Is it serious?

12:30.160 --> 12:32.360
Apparently, she became ill
as soon as she heard I planned to leave.

12:32.440 --> 12:34.320
It is just a heartache. Nothing major.

12:34.840 --> 12:37.120
I am sure once you have departed,
she will recover.

12:38.240 --> 12:39.120
I will make a bet with you.

12:39.200 --> 12:40.480
When you return safely,

12:40.560 --> 12:42.800
I will have convinced her
to let me live the life I want.

12:46.600 --> 12:49.440
- You all stay here and help Pin.
- No way!

12:50.680 --> 12:51.800
Don't you want to help her?

12:52.400 --> 12:54.280
What if you and Mr. Yang end up dead?

12:56.800 --> 12:58.320
That is not what I mean!

12:58.400 --> 13:01.520
What I mean is that I am not the type
to abandon my friends for a woman.

13:02.400 --> 13:03.640
Right?

13:03.720 --> 13:05.840
A true hero might have his heart
set on a fair maiden,

13:05.920 --> 13:07.800
but his ambition must span the world.

13:08.840 --> 13:10.320
After traveling thousands of miles,

13:10.400 --> 13:14.520
only then should he return in glory
to share his heart with his beloved.

13:15.760 --> 13:19.040
- Will your father approve of it?
- My father has no say over me.

13:21.680 --> 13:23.520
As long as he does not tie me down,
I will go!

13:24.480 --> 13:26.120
All right…! It is settled.

13:26.200 --> 13:28.200
If you agree, we will go together.

13:28.280 --> 13:30.640
If you do not agree,
we will simply follow you from behind.

13:31.640 --> 13:34.240
Even Mother said,
if you agree, we will go together.

13:34.320 --> 13:36.520
If you do not agree,
we will simply follow you from behind.

13:39.240 --> 13:40.240
Yingying,

13:40.960 --> 13:43.880
Bloom Society will always
have a place for you.

13:50.200 --> 13:51.560
If Ji Yingying ever needs assistance,

13:55.560 --> 13:58.440
Bloom Society will do everything to help!

14:22.560 --> 14:24.760
Very well, let's go together.

14:26.960 --> 14:27.960
Shoulder to shoulder,

14:29.080 --> 14:30.080
through storms and strife.

14:39.480 --> 14:41.080
The father and son from the Yang family
have arrived in Chang'an.

14:43.280 --> 14:45.840
Who among the nobles
does not know it is all a setup?

14:46.360 --> 14:48.960
But Yang Brocade is already ruined.

14:49.960 --> 14:51.720
No amount of explanation
will sway the nobles.

14:53.040 --> 14:56.240
If you are still worried,
I can meet with the Zheng family again.

14:58.640 --> 15:00.640
What does it matter if they know?

15:01.240 --> 15:03.080
As long as tomorrow's order is signed,

15:03.600 --> 15:06.400
they can scheme all they want,
but it will not change a thing.

15:08.560 --> 15:09.400
Very well.

15:11.280 --> 15:12.280
I will take my leave.

15:27.200 --> 15:29.640
Sir, we have news from Yizhou.

15:29.720 --> 15:31.560
Ms. Ji plans to explore a trade route
with foreign merchants.

15:31.640 --> 15:33.120
She will be departing in a few days.

15:34.280 --> 15:36.520
What about Bai Sheng?
Why has he not stopped her?

15:38.040 --> 15:40.600
Bai Sheng is going with her.

15:42.240 --> 15:43.120
What?

15:47.320 --> 15:49.440
Pack our things immediately.
We are leaving at once!

15:50.320 --> 15:51.360
What about the merchants
waiting to sign the orders?

15:51.440 --> 15:52.480
Should we just ignore them?

15:52.560 --> 15:55.080
Zhao Ping,
after all these years of working for me,

15:55.160 --> 15:56.520
have you still not learned
what matters most?

15:58.400 --> 15:59.440
Understood.

16:06.400 --> 16:08.640
YUEBUHUAN INN

16:14.280 --> 16:16.760
Finely embroidered pouches
made with the best silk threads.

16:16.840 --> 16:18.320
Take a look!

16:18.400 --> 16:19.240
Finely embroidered pouches

16:19.320 --> 16:21.000
and handkerchiefs
made with the best silk threads.

16:21.520 --> 16:22.400
No, I do not need them.

16:22.480 --> 16:24.000
YUEBUHUAN INN

16:38.560 --> 16:39.720
Finely embroidered pouches

16:39.800 --> 16:42.680
and handkerchiefs
made with the best silk threads.

16:43.240 --> 16:45.400
Come and see!

16:47.760 --> 16:48.720
Eat this.

16:52.880 --> 16:54.120
I am not hungry.

16:55.440 --> 16:57.840
I did not sell
a single handkerchief today.

16:58.440 --> 16:59.560
Here, take this.

17:09.920 --> 17:11.800
Are my embroidery skills really that bad?

17:13.480 --> 17:14.319
They are pretty bad.

17:16.160 --> 17:17.640
But at least the stitches are sturdy.

17:17.720 --> 17:20.079
The pouch just needs to hold money.

17:21.800 --> 17:23.119
All right. I will take this
as payment for your food.

17:23.839 --> 17:24.839
Eat slowly.

17:27.079 --> 17:27.920
Thank you, miss!

17:29.920 --> 17:32.080
Whenever you come to the city
to sell your goods,

17:32.640 --> 17:34.040
you will always have food waiting for you.

17:34.120 --> 17:36.440
It is not easy for a woman to do business.
Do your best.

17:49.480 --> 17:51.520
- Thank you.
- It is nothing.

17:52.040 --> 17:54.440
It is not easy for a woman to do business.
Do your best.

17:56.040 --> 17:57.240
Tell me.

17:58.200 --> 18:00.640
Do you think a woman
can really succeed in doing business?

18:01.320 --> 18:03.200
Who cares? Just keep doing it.

18:03.720 --> 18:06.080
After all, aren't all the new roads in
this world forged through determination?

18:29.440 --> 18:31.800
PEACE AND PROSPERITY

18:39.120 --> 18:41.280
Do you bring only one companion, Mr. Bai?

18:43.280 --> 18:46.200
With Mr. Yang here,
my safety is guaranteed.

18:47.240 --> 18:48.400
That is fine.

18:48.960 --> 18:51.080
But a caravan has its rules.

18:51.160 --> 18:52.640
We must agree on the terms.

18:53.880 --> 18:56.160
First, the caravan is large and complex.

18:56.760 --> 18:59.240
Everyone must follow
the orders of the leader. That is me.

18:59.320 --> 19:00.920
Otherwise, the penalty is death.

19:01.000 --> 19:04.160
Second, no one may act independently.

19:04.760 --> 19:06.400
Otherwise, the penalty is death.

19:07.280 --> 19:08.280
Third,

19:08.360 --> 19:10.920
my wife is the core of this caravan.

19:11.520 --> 19:13.880
No one is allowed to approach her
without permission.

19:13.960 --> 19:15.920
Otherwise, the penalty is death.

19:18.560 --> 19:21.160
Three death penalties. Fine.

19:21.680 --> 19:23.960
You are very bold, Mr. Yang.

19:25.640 --> 19:27.160
It may not apply to everyone,

19:27.240 --> 19:30.040
but when it comes to you, Mr. Bai,
I will enforce it to the letter.

19:31.760 --> 19:34.920
I understand.
Thank you for the reminder, Mr. Yang.

19:35.840 --> 19:37.680
All right. Everyone is here.

19:37.760 --> 19:39.680
The day is getting late. Let's set out.

19:41.520 --> 19:42.600
Wait a moment!

19:45.880 --> 19:46.720
Yu?

19:48.000 --> 19:48.960
I am coming with you!

19:50.240 --> 19:51.520
Did you not…

19:52.640 --> 19:53.880
You are right.

19:54.480 --> 19:57.040
All roads are made by people
brave enough to walk them.

19:57.120 --> 19:59.920
I must give this one a try.

20:01.640 --> 20:02.800
What about your inn?

20:03.680 --> 20:05.840
My inn can always reopen,

20:06.480 --> 20:10.400
but meeting kindred spirits like this
is very rare.

20:10.480 --> 20:11.680
Besides, I need to protect her.

20:15.960 --> 20:17.840
Very well. Let's set out!

20:19.920 --> 20:22.840
PEACE AND PROSPERITY

21:33.160 --> 21:34.280
This will not do!

21:34.360 --> 21:37.760
The rain is getting heavier!
Let's find somewhere to rest for a while!

21:37.840 --> 21:41.480
There is a cliff beside us!
There is nowhere to take shelter!

21:41.560 --> 21:42.840
We have to push through!

21:44.200 --> 21:47.440
Sang Shisi, you must believe in yourself.
You can do this!

22:13.840 --> 22:15.040
Put in some strength!

22:20.680 --> 22:21.520
‪Quickly!

22:22.120 --> 22:23.400
‪Move!

22:27.720 --> 22:28.960
A little more effort!

22:30.920 --> 22:31.760
‪Quickly!

22:31.840 --> 22:32.960
Watch out! Be careful!

22:38.320 --> 22:40.360
‪Move!

22:59.760 --> 23:02.480
YIZHOU

23:09.400 --> 23:13.000
Sir, Ms. Ji left three days ago.

23:13.520 --> 23:16.280
The Yang family gathered
the best caravan in the city,

23:16.360 --> 23:17.720
with Yang Jinglan as the leader.

23:18.680 --> 23:20.720
It is said the map
was provided by Bai Sheng,

23:21.880 --> 23:25.400
but Yang Jinglan does not trust him,
so he insisted Bai Sheng accompany them.

23:25.480 --> 23:27.040
What exactly is Bai Sheng planning?

23:27.120 --> 23:29.880
With Yang Jinglan
and a group of skilled guards along,

23:29.960 --> 23:31.880
at least you do not have to worry
about Ms. Ji's safety.

23:34.200 --> 23:38.320
The more prepared they are,
the more dangerous the journey must be.

23:39.840 --> 23:42.840
- As for Bai Sheng…
- Whatever their intentions,

23:43.360 --> 23:45.440
Ji Yingying is not one to sit idly by.

23:46.720 --> 23:50.360
If she dared to go,
she must be confident in her safe return.

23:52.640 --> 23:53.640
Am I wrong?

23:53.720 --> 23:55.800
I know what you are implying.

23:57.320 --> 24:00.360
Find that slave trader
and rescue Yu Yuan as soon as possible.

24:03.240 --> 24:04.080
Thank you, my dear.

24:12.800 --> 24:18.400
RECRUITMENT FOR BROCADE WORKSHOP
IN MIANZHOU

24:18.480 --> 24:20.320
A brocade workshop in Mianzhou
is hiring skilled workers!

24:20.400 --> 24:21.920
They will pay double the wages.

24:23.080 --> 24:25.440
Moreover, they will even
cover your travel expenses!

24:25.520 --> 24:29.720
Look, not only do they pay so much,
but they also offer annual leave.

24:31.040 --> 24:34.520
Spending lavishly?
These tactics feel all too familiar.

25:01.840 --> 25:03.200
I cannot continue…

25:03.280 --> 25:04.400
I cannot…

25:04.480 --> 25:05.400
I am too exhausted.

25:13.080 --> 25:14.480
- All right. Go ahead.
- Go on.

25:14.560 --> 25:15.400
Master.

25:17.680 --> 25:19.440
- Have a seat.
- Sure.

25:28.440 --> 25:30.000
I have been investigating along the way

25:30.520 --> 25:32.400
and found no sign of others
operating in the shadows.

25:32.480 --> 25:34.240
Could it be that

25:35.000 --> 25:38.400
Yang Jinglan only brought
these caravan guards

25:38.480 --> 25:40.760
and left his shadow guards behind
in Yizhou?

25:42.080 --> 25:46.280
It means he understands
the gravity of the situation there.

25:47.080 --> 25:51.480
We are planning in secret
and acting discreetly in Yizhou.

25:52.000 --> 25:53.320
It is likely he is doing the same.

25:54.120 --> 25:55.320
Here's what we will do.

25:55.400 --> 25:58.320
Inform our men in Yizhou not to alert him.

25:58.400 --> 25:59.960
There is no need to rush
in clearing the evidence.

26:00.040 --> 26:01.680
Take everything that needs to be removed
and leave nothing behind.

26:01.760 --> 26:02.720
Understood.

26:04.600 --> 26:06.200
But this caravan…

26:06.720 --> 26:09.680
The road ahead is nothing but danger.

26:12.600 --> 26:15.080
After so many years and so many journeys,

26:15.160 --> 26:17.120
hasn't every road
we have taken been perilous?

26:18.800 --> 26:20.520
The difference is, this time,

26:21.440 --> 26:23.200
we are not the only ones here.

26:45.280 --> 26:46.840
Mr. Zhao, it is you!

26:49.200 --> 26:50.960
You nearly scared me to death!

26:51.640 --> 26:53.080
Mr. Bai said

26:54.480 --> 26:55.960
you would come looking for me.

26:57.120 --> 26:59.280
He had a message for you.

26:59.360 --> 27:00.480
What is it?

27:01.000 --> 27:03.520
He said the Yang family

27:03.600 --> 27:06.160
is currently in dire straits,

27:06.240 --> 27:08.800
and you must help me
become the patriarch of the Yang family.

27:09.400 --> 27:11.720
That way, he can take what he wants,

27:11.800 --> 27:14.240
and you will get what you desire.

27:15.080 --> 27:17.160
- Is that all?
- Yes.

27:19.280 --> 27:21.880
- Then you are of no further use to me.
- Wait…! Mr. Zhao!

27:21.960 --> 27:25.160
What are you doing, Mr. Zhao?

27:25.240 --> 27:27.520
Mr. Bai said you were here to help me!

27:27.600 --> 27:28.600
You…!

27:29.120 --> 27:31.080
If you have any questions, just ask!

27:31.160 --> 27:33.640
Just ask me!
I will tell you everything I know!

27:36.160 --> 27:37.680
Have they mentioned when they will return?

27:39.720 --> 27:43.080
No…! But I assume he will return.

27:44.120 --> 27:47.160
He said that once I become the patriarch,

27:47.240 --> 27:49.680
he will take something
from the Yang family.

27:49.760 --> 27:51.840
But I am not the patriarch yet,

27:51.920 --> 27:54.640
and he has not taken anything,
and yet he has left.

27:55.160 --> 27:58.160
So, I guess he must come back.

27:58.240 --> 27:59.920
When he does,
Ji Yingying will likely return too.

28:00.920 --> 28:02.080
What about

28:02.160 --> 28:04.880
the brocade workshop in Mianzhou that
spent extravagantly to recruit workers?

28:04.960 --> 28:06.000
Was that his doing?

28:06.080 --> 28:07.560
That I do not know.

28:08.440 --> 28:11.440
I only heard about it today.

28:11.960 --> 28:15.560
But I do not think
it has anything to do with Mr. Bai.

28:15.640 --> 28:19.360
If he wanted to open a brocade workshop,
he could have done it in Yizhou.

28:19.440 --> 28:20.880
Why go all the way to Mianzhou?

28:23.880 --> 28:25.360
Tell me about the current situation
in the Yang family.

28:25.440 --> 28:27.080
All right…!

28:27.160 --> 28:32.320
Currently, Juxian and my two nephews
are negotiating in Chang'an,

28:32.400 --> 28:34.040
as you are likely aware.

28:34.680 --> 28:37.520
My sister-in-law
is managing the affairs at home.

28:39.760 --> 28:40.800
ELEGANCE IN SOLITUDE

28:41.480 --> 28:43.360
The Yang family
has not treated you poorly.

28:43.880 --> 28:45.920
And yet, for double the wages,
you are ready to leave?

28:57.200 --> 28:58.040
Madam.

29:02.240 --> 29:04.320
Send someone to deliver
a letter to Chang'an.

29:06.240 --> 29:09.120
Have Jingshan return as soon as possible.

29:10.760 --> 29:12.080
From today forward,

29:13.080 --> 29:15.400
whatever wages
the brocade workshop in Mianzhou offers,

29:15.920 --> 29:17.520
we will match them.

29:18.120 --> 29:19.400
Everyone, think carefully.

29:20.720 --> 29:22.520
Do you wish to leave your home

29:23.400 --> 29:25.000
or continue to stay here?

29:27.720 --> 29:31.360
The brocade workshop in Mianzhou
has now recruited 50 first-class weavers

29:31.440 --> 29:33.720
and 107 second-class weavers.

29:37.560 --> 29:38.960
There have not been any suspicions,
have there?

29:39.040 --> 29:41.480
Using high wages to poach talent
may not be the most honorable tactic,

29:41.560 --> 29:44.120
but it is common enough in business.

29:44.200 --> 29:46.920
Besides, we are spending real money here.

29:47.440 --> 29:50.240
Even when officers from Brocade Bureau
came to inspect,

29:50.320 --> 29:51.840
they found no faults.

29:51.920 --> 29:54.560
Instead, their visit confirmed
the benefits we are offering to be real,

29:54.640 --> 29:56.720
attracting even more craftsmen.

29:57.520 --> 29:58.640
However…

30:00.080 --> 30:00.920
What is it?

30:01.000 --> 30:03.560
Some of the craftsmen on the prince's list

30:03.640 --> 30:05.280
are key figures
in their respective workshops.

30:06.040 --> 30:07.840
They are well-treated

30:07.920 --> 30:10.040
and have strong ties
to their current employers.

30:10.120 --> 30:13.120
I am afraid no matter how much
we increase their wages,

30:13.200 --> 30:14.240
they are unlikely to come here.

30:14.320 --> 30:17.840
As for them, we will infiltrate quietly

30:17.920 --> 30:18.880
and take them directly
when the time comes.

30:18.960 --> 30:19.920
Understood.

30:22.160 --> 30:25.600
When will we act against the workshop?

30:28.440 --> 30:29.280
Come in.

30:30.920 --> 30:32.960
- Ms. Ning!
- Why are you anxious?

30:46.600 --> 30:48.000
Quick, deliver this letter
to His Highness!

30:48.840 --> 30:49.800
Understood.

31:04.360 --> 31:06.240
According to the map,
there is no path ahead.

31:06.920 --> 31:09.840
The cartographer said this forest
is called the Valley of Death.

31:09.920 --> 31:12.400
It is the shortest route to Tubo

31:12.480 --> 31:14.320
but also the most dangerous.

31:15.120 --> 31:16.640
If we take a detour,

31:16.720 --> 31:18.880
it will add
five to six times the travel time.

31:18.960 --> 31:21.040
And whether new dangers arise on
the alternative route is anyone's guess.

31:23.800 --> 31:25.040
The Valley of Death?

31:42.720 --> 31:46.840
It is getting late.
We will rest here for the night.

32:06.440 --> 32:09.040
The night is cold. Have some hot soup.

32:10.960 --> 32:11.960
Thank you.

32:32.400 --> 32:34.280
I have also lost loved ones,

32:35.080 --> 32:36.440
so I understand how it feels.

32:37.120 --> 32:38.920
No matter what others say,
it does not help.

32:39.000 --> 32:40.920
It is because you will not listen.

32:41.480 --> 32:43.160
Your heart

32:44.600 --> 32:46.720
is filled with the one
you will never see again.

32:48.560 --> 32:50.560
You replay your memories,

32:51.160 --> 32:53.200
wishing it was all a dream.

32:54.960 --> 32:56.920
But when you open your eyes…

32:58.720 --> 33:02.080
I realize at least Yingying is still here,
my mother is still here,

33:02.680 --> 33:04.480
and I am not alone.

33:05.720 --> 33:08.360
Thankfully,
this world still holds affection,

33:08.440 --> 33:10.720
family, and friends.

33:12.080 --> 33:13.560
My father

33:15.160 --> 33:18.320
would have wanted us
to protect those around us

33:19.120 --> 33:21.000
and embrace new journeys.

33:25.160 --> 33:26.400
They said

33:27.600 --> 33:31.640
my father remained in this forest
all those years ago,

33:34.640 --> 33:38.800
but no one has ever told me how he died.

33:39.560 --> 33:43.040
All they say is

33:44.720 --> 33:46.360
he died protecting the cargo.

33:46.880 --> 33:48.680
His body was never recovered.

33:55.400 --> 33:57.040
I am here now.

33:59.960 --> 34:02.120
But what is the point?

34:02.920 --> 34:04.640
I lost him long ago.

34:08.639 --> 34:11.280
He has always been here.

34:12.840 --> 34:15.280
I can weave brocade,
and Yingying can dye silk.

34:15.360 --> 34:17.440
These were all things
our father taught us.

34:18.480 --> 34:22.040
A part of him lives on
in our memories and skills,

34:22.120 --> 34:24.000
staying with us forever,

34:24.600 --> 34:26.040
protecting us.

34:28.040 --> 34:29.320
It is the same for you.

34:30.280 --> 34:33.520
Your father
gave you your skills and wisdom.

34:33.600 --> 34:36.159
He instilled in you
a broad perspective and a strong heart.

34:37.199 --> 34:38.760
He has always been by your side.

34:52.440 --> 34:56.520
I will always stand
where you can see me with just one glance.

34:57.280 --> 35:00.120
If you feel like talking, call me.

35:00.640 --> 35:02.360
If not, that is fine too.

35:27.800 --> 35:28.920
Father,

35:31.800 --> 35:33.440
are you truly here?

35:38.040 --> 35:39.480
If you are,

35:42.520 --> 35:44.680
then watch over me closely.

35:47.760 --> 35:50.400
I will use the skills you taught me

35:53.360 --> 35:55.640
to protect my friends

35:57.440 --> 36:02.400
and finish the road

36:04.560 --> 36:06.600
you could not complete.

36:31.600 --> 36:34.880
Sheng Dalang, have you been through
a forest like this before?

36:35.480 --> 36:37.080
Never. This is my first time.

36:37.600 --> 36:39.560
What a coincidence! It is the same as me!

36:40.200 --> 36:42.200
Can you take this seriously for once?

36:42.920 --> 36:44.640
What is there to be afraid of?
Can you at least try to match my mood?

36:44.720 --> 36:45.840
No.

36:46.960 --> 36:47.800
Stop!

37:04.000 --> 37:04.920
Is it wolves?

37:06.360 --> 37:07.560
No, they are bandits.

37:07.640 --> 37:08.680
Bandits?

37:09.520 --> 37:10.560
Bandits!

37:12.360 --> 37:13.840
Surround the wagons!

37:14.480 --> 37:15.800
Everyone else to the inner circle.

37:15.880 --> 37:17.120
Those who can fight,
stay with me on the outer side!

37:25.880 --> 37:26.880
You are smart.

37:28.000 --> 37:31.600
Since you have stopped running,
I will come and see you myself.

37:36.480 --> 37:38.000
You even have a little beauty
hiding among you.

37:38.840 --> 37:39.920
Brothers,

37:40.000 --> 37:42.120
be careful.

37:42.200 --> 37:44.800
Do not hurt her. Save her for me!

37:45.440 --> 37:46.280
Charge!

38:13.160 --> 38:14.880
Run! Hurry and run!

38:16.280 --> 38:17.600
I cannot, Shisi! I cannot run anymore!

38:17.680 --> 38:19.680
Run! The bandits are near!

38:19.760 --> 38:20.920
Help!

38:21.000 --> 38:22.680
Are we going the wrong way?

38:22.760 --> 38:23.720
It does not matter!

38:24.240 --> 38:25.600
We must save our lives first!

38:49.280 --> 38:50.240
You scoundrel!

38:58.320 --> 39:00.240
- Why are you here?
- I…

39:00.320 --> 39:01.200
Run!

39:02.960 --> 39:04.120
Stop right there!

39:15.040 --> 39:17.440
Yingying…! Hurry!

39:17.520 --> 39:20.720
Yingying! Yingying, hurry!
Go save Sheng Dalang!

39:21.760 --> 39:24.080
Go! Save Sheng Dalang! Sheng Dalang!

39:24.160 --> 39:26.640
He was right here. Just here!

39:31.000 --> 39:33.160
Sheng Dalang was just right here!

39:34.360 --> 39:36.240
Sheng Dalang?

39:41.520 --> 39:42.840
Sheng Dalang!

39:43.480 --> 39:44.720
Sheng Dalang?

39:46.240 --> 39:47.440
You go find Yingying.

39:47.520 --> 39:49.160
Sheng Dalang was just here.

39:49.240 --> 39:50.520
- Save him!
- Shisi!

39:50.600 --> 39:51.440
- Sheng Dalang!
- Shisi!

39:51.520 --> 39:52.640
- Sheng Dalang!
- Get up!

39:52.720 --> 39:54.800
- Sheng Dalang!
- Get up!

39:54.880 --> 39:55.760
Shisi!

39:55.840 --> 39:58.240
Get up, Shisi!

39:58.320 --> 40:00.600
- Do not stop me!
- Shisi!

40:03.280 --> 40:07.200
He gave his life to save you!
Was it so you could throw it away again?

40:11.680 --> 40:12.720
Think about it.

40:13.240 --> 40:16.920
If he is watching over you,
what do you think he would want you to do?

40:19.480 --> 40:22.680
He died saving me.

40:27.520 --> 40:28.720
Yingying…

40:44.400 --> 40:45.720
Sheng Dalang…

41:36.520 --> 41:37.480
It is fine.

41:41.600 --> 41:43.640
Dalang is gone.

41:45.560 --> 41:46.880
He is really gone.

41:54.280 --> 41:57.160
I knew this journey would not be smooth.

41:58.520 --> 42:03.920
I expected illness and injuries.

42:05.560 --> 42:07.600
But I thought that
if we were careful enough,

42:07.680 --> 42:09.080
if we prepared enough,

42:09.160 --> 42:10.960
we could protect everyone.

42:11.480 --> 42:12.440
But…

42:13.160 --> 42:17.160
I never imagined
it would happen so suddenly.

42:17.680 --> 42:19.000
His body was never recovered.

42:21.120 --> 42:23.040
That was Sheng Dalang!

42:24.000 --> 42:26.680
- It is fine…!
- Yang Jinglan,

42:27.800 --> 42:29.080
I am scared.

42:30.640 --> 42:32.720
Should we turn back?

42:33.440 --> 42:36.800
I do not want to lose anyone else.

42:39.520 --> 42:40.480
Yingying,

42:41.560 --> 42:44.520
everyone here made their own choice
to come this far.

42:46.200 --> 42:49.440
No one knows the ending of the story

42:50.720 --> 42:52.040
at the very beginning.
